Changes from PHPNuxBill: gobill is a rewrite of PHPNuxBill in Go, started 2026-10-08. Every
file ported from PHP names the PHP source it follows, and the git history records each change.
The translation files in lang/ (english, indonesia, spanish, turkish, arabic) originate from
PHPNuxBill (system/lan/*.json, and arabic.json from the upstream history). gobill adds keys to them.

Third-party components
----------------------

The full text of every third-party license is in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt. The binary embeds that
file, NOTICE and LICENSE, and serves them at /licenses. Each license in that file comes from the
module's own source.

